    37 5175 AD F8 14		 lda ovid
    38 5178 C9 02		 cmp #2
    39 517A 90 12		 bcc ov_sw
    40 517C C9 04		 cmp #4
    41 517E F0 0E		 beq ov_sw
    42 5180 AD FE 14		 lda ovrq
