    41 0545 6E EF 05		 ror cum2
    42 0548 CA			 dex
    43 0549 D0 F3		 bne cut0
    44 054B AD E7 05		 lda cux
    45 054E 29 07		 and #7
    46 0550 AA			 tax
    47 0551 F0 0C		 beq cut2
    48 0553 4E ED 05		cut1 lsr cum0
    49 0556 6E EE 05		 ror cum1
    50 0559 6E EF 05		 ror cum2
    51 055C CA			 dex
    52 055D D0 F4		 bne cut1
    53 055F AD E8 05		cut2 lda cux+1
    54 0562 4A			 lsr
    55 0563 AD E7 05		 lda cux
    56 0566 6A			 ror
    57 0567 4A			 lsr
    58 0568 4A			 lsr
    59 0569 8D F0 05		 sta cuby
    60 056C AD EB 05		 lda cura
    61 056F 85 86		 sta sp
    62 0571 AD EC 05		 lda cura+1
    63 0574 85 87		 sta sp+1
    64 0576 AE EA 05		 ldx cuh
    65 0579 AC F0 05		cut3 ldy cuby
    66 057C AD ED 05		 lda cum0
